Also, there's never any printing on it.
而且上面从来没有任何印刷图案。

482
00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:24.970
There's never any like name of grocery store.
从来没有写过任何杂货店的名字。

483
00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:27.730
It's just this solid brown bag.
它就是一个纯棕色的袋子。

484
00:24:27.970 --> 00:24:28.130
Yeah.
