Someone zhuzhed it up and then decided to wear a sweater that her mom made her because that's how you zhuzh up when your fella's coming.
有人帮她打理了一下，然后她决定穿上她妈妈织的毛衣，因为当你的心上人要回来时，你就是得这样精心打扮。

497
00:25:13.790 --> 00:25:15.090
Let me get that sweater.
让我把那件毛衣拿来。

