Michael shows her to her desk.
迈克尔带她去了她的办公桌。

550
00:27:47.210 --> 00:27:47.730
Yes.
是的。

551
00:27:47.850 --> 00:27:50.690
And he walks her to her desk, and they walk past accounting.
他陪她走到办公桌前，他们经过了会计部。

552
00:27:50.990 --> 00:27:52.270
Four minutes, 41 seconds.
四分四十一秒。

553
00:27:53.030 --> 00:27:56.070
Kevin is at his desk, but Angela is not.
凯文在座位上，但安吉拉不在。

554
