00:29:06.710 --> 00:29:07.110
No.
没有。

592
00:29:07.330 --> 00:29:08.210
It's not going to happen.
这不会发生的。

593
00:29:08.670 --> 00:29:09.110
No.
不会。

594
00:29:09.110 --> 00:29:13.670
So then we have Andy's talking head down in the parking lot.
然后是安迪在停车场里的个人采访。

595
00:29:13.810 --> 00:29:16.890
He's about to arrive, and I love this talking head.
他正准备到达，我超爱这段采访。

596
00:29:17.030 --> 00:29:20.870
He says he plans to be the number two in Scranton within weeks.
他说他计划在几周内成为斯克兰顿分部的二把手。

597
00:29:21.070 --> 00:29:22.870
